WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.426 --> 00:00:03.552
♪ [intro music] ♪

00:00:05.674 --> 00:00:07.101
Looking to manage access

00:00:07.101 --> 00:00:10.210
to your organization's 
Google Cloud resources with ease?

00:00:10.675 --> 00:00:12.796
Give me one minute and I'll show you how

00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:15.312
with Cloud Identity 
and Access Management.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.916
Cloud Identity and Access Management

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:21.766
enables you to grant access 
to cloud resources at fine-grain levels

00:00:22.096 --> 00:00:23.921
and gives you visibility and tools

00:00:23.921 --> 00:00:26.396
for centrally managing 
your cloud resources.

00:00:27.313 --> 00:00:31.235
Access can be granted to resources 
based on attributes like resource type,

00:00:31.585 --> 00:00:34.166
so that users get access 
only to what they need

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:35.640
to get the job done.

00:00:35.977 --> 00:00:37.938
IAM provides a unified view

00:00:37.938 --> 00:00:41.603
into security policy
across your entire organization

00:00:41.603 --> 00:00:44.711
with built-in auditing to easy 
your compliance processes.

00:00:45.361 --> 00:00:47.917
Use Cloud IAM with Resource Manager

00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:50.201
to easily modify your access policies

00:00:50.201 --> 00:00:53.441
for your organization, 
folders, and projects.

00:00:54.043 --> 00:00:57.991
Built-in policy intelligence, 
machine learning and automation tools

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.695
help you reduce your risk.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.437
For example, IAM Recommender

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:05.054
automatically detects 
overly permissive access

00:01:05.054 --> 00:01:06.695
and helps you rightsize.

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.411
Cloud IAM Resource Manager
and the tools and policy intelligence

00:01:11.411 --> 00:01:14.838
are available in the Cloud Console, 
gcloud command line tool,

00:01:14.838 --> 00:01:16.999
and programmatically through REST APIs.

00:01:17.628 --> 00:01:20.159
So next time you're looking
to smartly and efficiently

00:01:20.159 --> 00:01:22.967
manage secure access 
to your cloud deployment,

00:01:22.967 --> 00:01:25.300
take a minute to look at Cloud IAM.

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:29.422
To learn more, check out 
<i>cloud.google.com/iam</i>

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:33.034
♪ [outro music] ♪

